From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: H96 build <builder@h96-build>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/20] drm/edid: guard override EDID against a cleared EDID
 blob

drm_get_override_edid() dereferenced connector->edid_blob_ptr whenever
override_edid was set; the blob is cleared on disconnect while the
flag stays set. Check the blob pointer too.

H96 series: d3299ab29 / 1f3193932.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c
index fc6028aae..3de2e7ef3 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c
@@ -2188,7 +2188,8 @@ static struct edid *drm_get_override_edid(struct drm_connector *connector,
 {
 	struct edid *override = NULL;
 
-	if (connector->override_edid)
+	/* the blob is cleared on disconnect while override_edid stays set */
+	if (connector->override_edid && connector->edid_blob_ptr)
 		override = drm_edid_duplicate(connector->edid_blob_ptr->data);
 
 	if (!override)
